And presented two new signature

00:31:01.465 --> 00:31:06.198
schemes in the Rhom and Kurhom.

00:31:06.199 --> 00:31:11.151
Right, but the first part of
the optimization also has

00:31:11.152 --> 00:31:15.898
of course other applications
anywhere you want to.

00:31:15.899 --> 00:31:20.566
Have a, for example
a non-interactive zero knowledge

00:31:20.567 --> 00:31:24.648
proof of some circuit
in a post setting.

00:31:24.649 --> 00:31:29.487
Right, yeah, we've submitted
those two signature

00:31:29.488 --> 00:31:34.972
schemes to the NIST Post Quantum
competition, but there's

00:31:34.973 --> 00:31:39.720
